flowchart TD
  A[Select validated synthetic incident] --> B[Show timeline and deterministic risk]
  B --> C[Retrieve policies with TF-IDF threshold]
  C --> D{Policy match?}
  D -- No --> E[Show no-match; AI and approval locked]
  D -- Yes --> F[Analyst requests AI analysis]
  F --> G{Usable current-ID-cited report?}
  G -- No --> H[Show safe error; approval locked]
  G -- Yes --> I[Show report and enable one decision]
  I --> J{Approve or reject?}
  J --> K[Record simulated session audit]
  K --> L[Lock decision controls for report]
